# QGUARD HELIX

# RUNTIME CRYPTOGRAPHIC INTELLIGENCE — SIMPLIFIED ENTERPRISE REFactor

Refactor the existing Qguard Helix page:

`/dashboard/runtime-crypto-intel`

into a **simple, professional, easy-to-understand Runtime Cryptographic Intelligence dashboard**.

The page must provide real-time visibility into cryptographic activity without overwhelming users with unnecessary technical information.

The primary goal is:

> **Show users what cryptography is running, whether it is quantum-safe, what needs attention, and what action they should take.**

Do NOT turn this into a complex SIEM.

Do NOT expose every raw telemetry field.

Do NOT create unnecessary tabs, charts, controls, or configuration screens.

Focus only on information that helps users understand and act.

